  "details": "Even after friends have logged off, if their last status was orange it will say they are still in the game on the website. \nRepro: N/A, it happens often, but sometimes it doesn't happen. \nExpected: After a user logs off with orange status it should be updated in website around 2-5 minutes later. \nActual: After a user logs off with orange status, there is a chance they will still be online on the website for a couple hours or days. \nI have seen this in my friends list and other friends have messaged me with the same problem when I use orange status. \nPictures: These were both taken less than 5 seconds apart, the VRC website and VRC friends list. This is a friend of mine, it happens with other accounts, but this is a friend I see most often.",
